<title>POLAND: BYTOM TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 28.</title>
<headline>BYTOM TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 13,179 shares of Polish garment maker Bytom SA at 28 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Bytom was flat at 27.5 zlotys in a volume of 2,134 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
